<title>USA: Highland Village, Texas, won by First Tennessee.</title>
<headline>Highland Village, Texas, won by First Tennessee.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Tennessee Bank said it won $4.090 million of Highland Village, Texas, combination tax and revenue limited tax certificates of obligation, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.27 percent.</p>
</text>
